<ScenContainer xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance">
  <ScenTitle>Landing Party, 2002</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;B&gt;Date:&lt;/B&gt; 26 May 2002 &lt;BR&gt;&lt;B&gt;Location:&lt;/B&gt; Arabian Sea &lt;BR&gt;&lt;B&gt;Playable Side:&lt;/B&gt; India &lt;BR&gt;&lt;B&gt;Duration:&lt;/B&gt; 36 hours &lt;BR&gt;
&lt;P&gt;Tensions between India and Pakistan are at an all time high following an attack on the Indian Parliament in December of 2001. Both India and Pakistan have mobilised their forces, deploying hundreds of thousands of troops along the border. Mortar and artillery fire has been exchanged in the Kashmir region, and 2 days ago the Pakistani government commenced a series of nuclear tests.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;As part of the war plan, the &lt;I&gt;INS Shalki&lt;/I&gt; of the Indian Navy is tasked with deploying a MARCOS special operations team to the port of Karachi to conduct reconnaissance. The Pakistani forces are on high alert, and the entire region is on a thermonuclear hair-trigger... &lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
